WEBVTT

00:14:29.389 --> 00:14:32.423
Njerez qe largoheshin nga Oklahoma drejt Kalifornise

00:14:32.423 --> 00:14:34.866
ne turma drejt nje te ardhmeje me te mire.

00:14:34.866 --> 00:14:36.655
Sot, kur shohim ndryshimin demografik,

00:14:36.655 --> 00:14:37.815
njerezit qe transferohen ketu nga perendimi,

00:14:37.815 --> 00:14:39.443
duket se sot po shohim

00:14:39.443 --> 00:14:42.291
qetesimin e terbimit.

00:14:42.291 --> 00:14:44.104
(te qeshura)

00:14:44.104 --> 00:14:47.169
(duartrokitje)

00:14:47.169 --> 00:14:51.714
Niperit po kthehen ne shtepi.

00:14:51.714 --> 00:14:53.502
Ishit nje publik i mrekullueshem 
dhe shume i vemendshem.

00:14:53.502 --> 00:14:55.953
Faleminderit per ftesen.

00:14:55.953 --> 00:14:58.496
(duartrokitje)